<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Davox upgraded.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Davox upgraded.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- First Albany Corp said it upgraded Davox Corp to buy from neutral.</p>
<p>-- said earnings estimates remain $1.49 a share for 1997 and $1.43 a share in 1998.</p>
<p>-- recommends investors take advantage of the recent price weakness in Davox shares and buy.</p>
<p>(( -- Wall Street desk 212-859-1730))</p>
</text>
